{"id":"00050d26-fff4-48d8-b0c6-26b68f262754","createdAt":"2026-10-26T11:57:31.788Z","batchId":"settings_qwen3-8-flash-gateway_medium","approach":"html","modelId":"qwen3.8-flash-gateway","settings":{"effort":"medium"},"presetId":"settings","prompt":"An account settings panel with profile, notifications and privacy sections.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<div class=\"page\">\n\n<h1>Account Settings</h1>\n<p class=\"lead\">Manage your profile, notification preferences, and privacy controls.</p>\n\n<div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n  <button class=\"btn btn-primary tab-btn active\" data-tab=\"profile\">Profile</button>\n  <button class=\"btn btn-secondary tab-btn\" data-tab=\"notifications\">Notifications</button>\n  <button class=\"btn btn-secondary tab-btn\" data-tab=\"privacy\">Privacy &amp; Security</button>\n</div>\n\n<!-- ═══════════ PROFILE ═══════════ -->\n<div id=\"tab-profile\" class=\"tab-panel\">\n\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <div class=\"card-title\">Profile Information</div>\n    <p class=\"card-desc\">This information is visible to your teammates and collaborators.</p>\n\n    <div class=\"stack gap-lg\">\n\n      <div class=\"row center gap-lg\">\n        <div class=\"avatar\" style=\"width:80px;height:80px;border-radius:50%;font-size:2rem;background:#e0e0e0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\">AK</div>\n        <div class=\"stack\">\n          <button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline\">Change avatar</button>\n          <span class=\"muted small\">JPG, PNG or GIF. Max 2 MB.</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <hr>\n\n      <div class=\"grid cols-2\">\n        <label>Full name\n          <input type=\"text\" value=\"Aisha Karim\" />\n        </label>\n        <label>Username\n          <input type=\"text\" value=\"aisha-karim\" />\n          <span class=\"muted small\">Your public handle on the platform.</span>\n        </label>\n      </div>\n\n      <label>Email address\n        <input type=\"email\" value=\"aisha.karim@northline.io\" />\n        <span class=\"muted small\">Primary email for account recovery and notifications.</span>\n      </label>\n\n      <label>Display name\n        <input type=\"text\" value=\"Aisha K.\" />\n      </label>\n\n      <label>Bio\n        <textarea rows=\"3\">Product design lead at Northline. Building tools that make distributed teams feel a little closer.</textarea>\n      </label>\n\n      <div class=\"grid cols-2\">\n        <label>Timezone\n          <select>\n            <option>UTC−05:00 Eastern (US &amp; Canada)</option>\n            <option selected>UTC+00:00 London</option>\n            <option>UTC+01:00 Berlin</option>\n            <option>UTC+02:00 Athens</option>\n            <option>UTC+03:00 Moscow</option>\n            <option>UTC−08:00 Pacific (US &amp; Canada)</option>\n            <option>UTC+05:30 Mumbai</option>\n            <option>UTC+09:00 Tokyo</option>\n          </select>\n        </label>\n        <label>Language\n          <select>\n            <option selected>English (UK)</option>\n            <option>English (US)</option>\n            <option>Français</option>\n            <option>Deutsch</option>\n            <option>Español</option>\n            <option>日本語</option>\n            <option>Português</option>\n          </select>\n        </label>\n      </div>\n\n      <label>Personal website\n        <input type=\"url\" value=\"https://aishakarim.design\" placeholder=\"https://\" />\n      </label>\n\n      <div class=\"between\">\n        <p class=\"muted small\">Last updated 3 days ago · <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Verified email</span></p>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n          <button class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-sm\">Cancel</button>\n          <button class=\"btn btn-primary btn-sm\">Save profile</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- ═══════════ NOTIFICATIONS ═══════════ -->\n<div id=\"tab-notifications\" class=\"tab-panel\" hidden>\n\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <div class=\"card-title\">Email Notifications</div>\n    <p class=\"card-desc\">Choose which emails you'd like to receive. Unsubscribe at any time.</p>\n\n    <div class=\"stack\">\n      <label class=\"check\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" checked /> Mentions &amp; replies to my threads\n      </label>\n      <label class=\"check\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" checked /> Comments on my projects\n      </label>\n      <label class=\"check\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" checked /> Tasks reassigned or overdue\n      </label>\n      <label class=\"check\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" /> Weekly summary digest (Mondays, 08:00 local)\n      </label>\n      <label class=\"check\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" checked /> Security alerts — new device sign-ins\n      </label>\n      <label class=\"check\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" /> Product updates &amp; changelog\n      </label>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <div class=\"card-title\">Push &amp; Desktop Notifications</div>\n    <p class=\"card-desc\">Real-time alerts delivered to your devices.</p>\n\n    <div class=\"stack\">\n      <div class=\"between\">\n        <span>Desktop push notifications</span>\n        <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked /> Enabled</label>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"between\">\n        <span>Mobile push notifications</span>\n        <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked /> Enabled</label>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"between\">\n        <span>Notification sound</span>\n        <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" /> Mute sounds</label>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <hr>\n\n    <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n      <button class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-sm\">Pause notifications for 1 hour</button>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-sm\">Pause for 24 hours</button>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-outline btn-sm\">Mute all for this week</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <div class=\"card-title\">Notification Schedule</div>\n    <p class=\"card-desc\">Do-not-disturb windows hide non-urgent alerts outside your working hours.</p>\n\n    <div class=\"grid cols-2\">\n      <label>Quiet hours start\n        <input type=\"time\" value=\"21:00\" />\n      </label>\n      <label>Quiet hours end\n        <input type=\"time\" value=\"07:00\" />\n      </label>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"stack gap-sm\" style=\"margin-top:.5rem\">\n      <span class=\"small\">Skip quiet hours on</span>\n      <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n        <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked /> Weekends</label>\n        <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked /> Public holidays</label>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"between\" style=\"margin-top:1.25rem\">\n      <p class=\"muted small\">Changes apply to email and push channels.</p>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-primary btn-sm\">Save notification settings</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n\n<!-- ═══════════ PRIVACY ═══════════ -->\n<div id=\"tab-privacy\" class=\"tab-panel\" hidden>\n\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <div class=\"card-title\">Profile Visibility</div>\n    <p class=\"card-desc\">Control who can find and view your profile.</p>\n\n    <label>\n      <span>Who can see my profile</span>\n      <select>\n        <option selected>Everyone</option>\n        <option>Only people in my workspace</option>\n        <option>Only me</option>\n      </select>\n    </label>\n\n    <div class=\"stack gap-sm\" style=\"margin-top:.75rem\">\n      <span class=\"small\">Additional visibility</span>\n      <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked /> Appear in internal member directory</label>\n      <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" /> Show activity status (green dot when online)</label>\n      <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" /> Allow search engines to index my public profile</label>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <div class=\"card-title\">Data &amp; Privacy</div>\n    <p class=\"card-desc\">Decide how your data is used to improve the platform.</p>\n\n    <div class=\"stack\">\n      <label class=\"check\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" /> Share anonymised usage analytics\n        <span class=\"muted small\">Helps us understand which features are most useful.</span>\n      </label>\n      <label class=\"check\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" checked /> Allow personalised recommendations\n        <span class=\"muted small\">Surfaces templates and projects based on your workspace activity.</span>\n      </label>\n      <label class=\"check\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" /> Enable third-party integrations to read profile data\n        <span class=\"muted small\">Required for Slack, Figma and Notion sync.</span>\n      </label>\n    </div>\n\n    <hr>\n\n    <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n      <button class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-sm\">Download my data</button>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-outline btn-sm\">Manage connected apps</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <div class=\"card-title\">Two-Factor Authentication</div>\n    <p class=\"card-desc\">Add an extra layer of security to your account.</p>\n\n    <div class=\"between\">\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <span class=\"stat-value\">2FA status: <span class=\"down\">Disabled</span></span>\n        <span class=\"muted small\">Your account has password-only sign-in. Enable 2FA to protect against credential stuffing.</span>\n      </div>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-primary btn-sm\">Set up 2FA</button>\n    </div>\n\n    <hr>\n\n    <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n      <span class=\"small\">Active sessions</span>\n      <table>\n        <thead><tr><th>Device</th><th>Location</th><th>Last active</th><th class=\"num\">Action</th></tr></thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr>\n            <td>MacBook Pro · Chrome</td>\n            <td>London, UK</td>\n            <td>Just now <span class=\"badge\">Current</span></td>\n            <td class=\"num\"><button class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\">Revoke</button></td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td>iPhone 15 · Safari</td>\n            <td>London, UK</td>\n            <td>2 hours ago</td>\n            <td class=\"num\"><button class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\">Revoke</button></td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td>Windows 11 · Firefox</td>\n            <td>Berlin, DE</td>\n            <td>6 days ago</td>\n            <td class=\"num\"><button class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\">Revoke</button></td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card alert-destructive\">\n    <div class=\"card-title\">Delete Account</div>\n    <p class=\"card-desc\">Permanently removes your profile, all projects, and workspace memberships. This cannot be undone.</p>\n    <div class=\"between\">\n      <span class=\"muted small\">You'll be asked to confirm your password before deletion.</span>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-destructive btn-sm\">Delete account</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<style>\n.tab-btn.active{background:var(--clr-primary);color:#fff;border-color:var(--clr-primary)}\n.tab-panel{margin-top:1.25rem}\n.card{margin-bottom:1.25rem}\n.avatar{overflow:hidden;font-weight:700;color:#444;letter-spacing:1px}\n.alert-destructive{border-left:4px solid var(--clr-destructive);background:var(--clr-destructive-bg,rgba(220,40,40,.07))}\nlabel{display:flex;flex-direction:column}\nlabel.check{flex-direction:row;align-items:flex-start;gap:.5rem;cursor:pointer}\nlabel.check input{margin-top:.2rem}\ntable td.num{text-align:right}\n.btn-ghost{background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;color:var(--clr-muted)}\n.btn-ghost:hover{color:var(--clr-destructive);text-decoration:underline}\n</style>\n\n<script>\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.tab-btn').forEach(btn => {\n  btn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n    document.querySelectorAll('.tab-btn').forEach(b => {\n      b.classList.remove('active');\n      b.classList.add('btn-secondary');\n      b.classList.remove('btn-primary');\n    });\n    btn.classList.add('active');\n    btn.classList.remove('btn-secondary');\n    btn.classList.add('btn-primary');\n\n    document.querySelectorAll('.tab-panel').forEach(p => p.hidden = true);\n    document.getElementById('tab-' + btn.dataset.tab).hidden = false;\n  });\n});\n</script>","deltas":[[6017,"<div class=\"page"],[6176,"\">\n\n<h1"],[6178,">"],[6215,"Account Settings</h"],[6217,"1>\n<p"],[6336," class=\"lead\">"],[6374,"Manage your profile,"],[6375," notification"],[6453," preferences, and privacy"],[6531," controls.</p>"],[6534,"\n\n<div"],[6535," class=\"row gap"],[6650,"-sm\">\n "],[6652," <button"],[6770," class=\"btn btn"],[6847,"-primary tab-btn active"],[6849,"\" data-tab"],[6890,"=\"profile\">Profile"],[6891,"</button"],[6892,">\n  <"],[7002,"button class=\"btn"],[7070," btn-secondary tab-btn"],[7071,"\""],[7106," data-tab=\"notifications"],[7107,"\">Notifications</"],[7109,"button>\n "],[7177," <button class=\""],[7213,"btn btn-secondary tab"],[7288,"-btn\" data-tab"],[7411,"=\"privacy\">Privacy"],[7412," &"],[7412,"amp; Security</"],[7439,"button>\n</"],[7591,"div>\n\n<!--"],[7593," ═════════"],[7603,"══"],[7612," PROFILE ═════"],[7621,"══════"],[7729," -->\n<div id"],[7803,"=\"tab-profile\""],[7803," class=\"tab"],[7804,"-panel\">\n\n "],[7804," <div class"],[7831,"=\"card\">\n"],[7833,"    <div"],[7938," class=\"card-title"],[7971,"\">P